1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
Find the gift that makes him say, wow, exactly what I needed.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,920
He's already got a drill, a hammer, everything.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,120
What do you get the man who fixes it all himself?

4
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,160
Get him something he'll actually use.

5
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:15,640
A chimney sweep kit with flexible rods, for the stove, cabin or house.

6
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,120
He screws it together and tries it that same evening.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:22,280
And you see it on him, that smile, when the gift hits the mark.

8
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,040
Not just another thing in a box.

9
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:27,360
A gift he'll mention the next time the stove is lit.

10
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,560
Chimney sweep kit with flexible rods.

11
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:33,120
The perfect gift for the man who does it all himself.
